s=s.replace('''// The context is what replaced them, and it is the one thing that was missing:''','''// Fixable came back on its own merits: it is the one figure that says what can
// be done, which none of the removed ones did.
//
// The context is what replaced them, and it is the one thing that was missing:''',1)
